# Brewfile.lifetime — standalone macOS package manifest for the Life Time
# work laptop (Homebrew prefix /Users/e9004590/homebrew).
# Apply with:  scripts/macOS/install_lifetime_tools.zsh  (preferred)
#         or:  brew bundle --file=$DOTFILES/Brewfile.lifetime
#
# Standalone: on the Life Time laptop this replaces the main Brewfile rather
# than adding to it, so bootstrap.sh (which applies the main Brewfile) is not
# the install path there.
#
# Seeded 2026-11-13 from `brew bundle dump` on the personal Mac, so it lists
# everything installed there. Every entry starts commented out — uncomment the
# ones the Life Time laptop needs. `trusted:` options from the dump were
# dropped; the install script trusts the taps of uncommented entries via
# scripts/macOS/lib/brew_trust.sh, same as the other Brewfiles.

